idden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202681JfXQI6jW1795070820.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" alt=\"4325.jpg\" title=\"4325.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; display: block; object-fit: contain;\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">趙晞文認為股價回落至81元才買入，目標價看95元，止蝕價在70元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">華虹宏力(1347)</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">買入：$81</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">目標：$95</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">止蝕：$70</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div data-bs-component=\"generic\" class=\"image-block responsive-block\" style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o1DqaGdsi51795070833.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" alt=\"4326.jpg\" title=\"4326.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; display: block; object-fit: contain;\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p>",
